  <title>Loans</title>

  <p><guiseq><gui>Accounting</gui><gui>Loans</gui></guiseq> lists the loans
  recorded, and adds a new one under <gui>New loan</gui>:</p>

  <steps>
    <item><p>Choose the <gui>Date started</gui> and the <gui>Contact</gui> who
    lent the money, and type a <gui>Description</gui> and the
    <gui>Amount</gui>.</p></item>
    <item><p>Choose the <gui>Payment period</gui>: how many days, weeks,
    months or years between payments. The main window's to-do list reminds you
    when a payment is due.</p></item>
    <item><p>Choose the <gui>Liability account</gui> the loan is owed on, and
    the account the money was <gui>Deposited to</gui>. <gui>Refresh</gui>
    reloads the accounts.</p></item>
    <item><p>Click <gui>Save</gui>.</p></item>
  </steps>

  <p>Payments are made in <link xref="loan_payment"/>, and the loan's history
  is in <link xref="loan_payments"/>.</p>

</page>
